<<Scene "lounge bg draft 3">>
<<Act "Aelius" "Aelius 3_4s" "left" "bottom" #674ea7>>
<<Act "Aphrodite" "Aphrodite" "right" "bottom" #e06666>>

Aphrodite: Good evening, Aelius. It's wonderful to see you.
Aelius: Hi, Aphrodite, it's good to see you too.
Aphrodite: I hope you have had a pleasant day.
Aelius: You seem like you’re in a good mood today, has Hephaestus talked to you yet?
Aphrodite: Practical as always, Aelius.
Aphrodite: Yes, and it has certainly improved my demeanor.
Aphrodite: Although it’s more of just an arrangement to meet and talk more later.

Aelius: [Positive] That's something at least; I am glad.
Aphrodite: I just wanted to stop by and thank you for helping Hephy.

// WEIRD OPTION SELECTION LOGIC HERE NEEDS TO BE IMPLEMENTED

-> Do you think you would take him bac?
    Aphrodite: It is not solely my decision, it must be decided together.
    Aphrodite: If I could… I believe I would like to start over with him.
-> Hephy?
    Aphrodite: Love is a kind of madness, dear. One can’t be held responsible for the way it makes them act.
    Aelius: If you say so.
-> Why did you decide to leave him anyway?
    Aphrodite: As I said, it was when I was much younger, less wise.
    Aphrodite: Hephaestus has always been… withdrawn.
    Aphrodite: And so I sought more – more love, more attention – what I thought was more befitting of the goddess of love.
    Aelius: And so, Ares.
    Aphrodite: Yes...
    Aphrodite: He had the excitement, the melodrama, that I was looking for.
    Aphrodite: But Ares treats everything like war; he lacks the subtlety required for romance.
    Aelius: I've noticed.

Aelius: Would you like anything to eat?
Aphrodite: Yes, I would thank you. You still have <b>Ambrosia Cake,</b> yes?
Aelius: Coming right up.

// AMBROSIA CAKE game

-> Spicy
    Aphrodite: You take a different approach than Hestia did. The spice is a worthy addition.
-> Fancy
    Aphrodite: Just as Hestia makes it, this is wonderful work, dear.
-> Playful
    Aphrodite: Just as I remember it, but maybe sweeter. Good work, dear.

Aelius: [Positive] I'm glad you like it.
Aphrodite: Thank you for listening, Aelius. I have not been able to talk about this in so long.
Aelius: [Positive] Of course.
Aphrodite: I must confess I feel a degree of nervousness about tomorrow.
Aelius: [Positive] I'm sure you'll be fine.
Aphrodite: You’ve talked to him more than I, what do you think?

-> I think you both should give it another chance.
    Aphrodite: I am happy you think so.
    Aphrodite: Thank you for your confidence, Aelius.
-> It's not my place to say.
    Aphrodite: Yes, you are correct.
    Aelius: I'm sorry I can't offer more.
    Aphrodite: Do not worry, dear. I must take responsibility for myself.
-> I think you should take it slow.
    Aphrodite: Yes, it would be best to avoid another mistake.
    Aphrodite: Thank you for your wisdom, Aelius.

Aelius: Thank you for stopping by.
Aphrodite: Thank you, Aelius, for your help and for the meal.
Aphrodite: I will be in your debt, no matter how tomorrow goes.
Aelius: Good luck, Aphrodite.
